{
    "version": "4eb1b1f7a7a2eef59820dea5ae91c70da4b2c4f9",
    "description": "UNG220Z（九联/Unionman 中国移动光猫）凭据提取工具：经 Telnet 读取设备配置库，找回 Web/Telnet/PPPoE/WiFi/root 口令，仅限自有设备",
    "homepage": "https://github.com/Hut-hzf/ung220z-tool",
    "license": "MIT",
    "depends": "python312",
    "url": "https://github.com/Hut-hzf/ung220z-tool/archive/4eb1b1f7a7a2eef59820dea5ae91c70da4b2c4f9.zip",
    "hash": "e18ae94eb19ea506e576a89cee68468448a940792dc52b16e8f851c04324eda5",
    "extract_dir": "ung220z-tool-4eb1b1f7a7a2eef59820dea5ae91c70da4b2c4f9",
    "persist": "logs",
    "installer": {
        "script": [
            "$wrapper = Join-Path $dir 'bin\\ung220z.cmd'",
            "$null = New-Item -ItemType Directory -Path (Split-Path $wrapper) -Force",
            "$content = @(",
            "    '@echo off',",
            "    'cd /d \"%~dp0..\\logs\" || exit /b 1',",
            "    'set \"PY=\"',",
            "    'for %%P in (python312 python3 python) do (',",
            "    '    if not defined PY (',",
            "    '        where /q %%P && set \"PY=%%P\"',",
            "    '    )',",
            "    ')',",
            "    'if not defined PY (',",
            "    '    echo [ung220z] Python interpreter not found. Run: scoop install python312',",
            "    '    exit /b 9009',",
            "    ')',",
            "    '\"%PY%\" \"%~dp0..\\ung220z.py\" %*'",
            ")",
            "Set-Content -Path $wrapper -Value $content -Encoding Ascii"
        ]
    },
    "bin": "bin\\ung220z.cmd",
    "notes": [
        "需与光猫管理网段互通（默认 192.168.1.1，需 80 与 23 端口可达），仅限自有设备用于找回密码、迁移配置或安全自查。",
        "口令以明文打印到屏幕，并写入 <persist>\\ung220z-tool\\logs 下的日志文件；该目录升级与卸载（不带 -p）都会保留，请勿提交到 git 或分享。",
        "root 口令比对依赖 openssl（scoop install openssl）；未安装时只输出 /etc/shadow 中的哈希。",
        "用法：ung220z [-i 192.168.1.1] [-u user] [-p 密码] [--telnet-password 口令] [--no-browser] [--unlock]"
    ],
    "checkver": {
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/Hut-hzf/ung220z-tool/commits/main",
        "jsonpath": "$.sha"
    },
    "autoupdate": {
        "url": "https://github.com/Hut-hzf/ung220z-tool/archive/$version.zip",
        "extract_dir": "ung220z-tool-$version"
    }
}
